        "created_at": "2020-01-28T13:41:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You get no prize from me! :D Thanks tho.</p>\n<p>This was fun and decently easy, though Challenge Blade (especially in Mordengrad!) is always a heart-pounder. I was a little sad when I lost my laser cannon, but I had drawn the Explosive Reconstructor the turn previous, so it ended up not mattering. I think Blade had a whole 8 cards in his trash by the end.</p>",
